         python3-pyside6.qtwidgets,
         boswas-device-agent (>= 1.0~alpha3),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Boswas OS Compatibility Manager for Windows applications
 The desktop application for Windows applications on Boswas OS (KDE
 Plasma):
 .
  * install Windows programs (.exe) and Windows Installer packages (.msi)
    after checking them against the compatibility catalog and the device
    policy, with live progress
  * launch, stop, repair, update and remove applications, and read their
    logs
  * read-only view of each application's permissions (files, network,
    display, audio, GPU, AppArmor confinement)
  * health of Wine, AppArmor and bubblewrap, of the device agent and of the
    Control Plane connection
  * "Install with Boswas Compatibility Manager" in the Dolphin context menu
 .
 The Compatibility Manager runs as the user and never runs programs itself:
 every operation goes through the user's Boswas session service, so the
 sandbox, AppArmor confinement and policy always apply. Only 64-bit (x86_64)
 Windows applications are supported.
